n/vat/vat-directive/vat-refunds_en','https://globalrules.org/compare/tax-free-shopping','2026-09-27','MEDIUM-HIGH','YES','Show ''Tax refund available''; keep threshold/source date visible.','Tax refund available','tripto.to-tax-refund-v1.0',180,'YES');
